      "mergeID": "66a904e678d929dcc6fba255",
      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Open VRChat in Desktop Mode (which I tested in). I am unsure if this affects VR.\n\n2. Open a World Playlist that has a max of 100 Favorites.\n\n3. Try scrolling to the bottom of the list until it prevents you from scrolling down further. There should be another row cut off on the bottom.\n\nSee screenshot attached, the issue lies where the Cursor is hovering over.\n\nHere's the Log. When viewing the Log, please note I placed the Timestamp as instructed via the \"Report Bug\" button in the Main Menu when the issue occurred: https://gist.github.com/BluWizard10/74176c3fb2fb7f12fefa85da5fffc6ba",
